 "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/6fba1d8996c564334504337b58d52cee.webp?t=1788888960\" width=601 height=41 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/fbf831f355b29793f7f8829094e98827.avif?t=1788888960\" width=1515 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Welcome to The NO JUMPSCARE Show!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Brought to you by Polypaw, this is a narrative comedy short horror game that promises a 100% jumpscare-free experience! ...Hopefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/ca7bf504c77cdc35543150f5a7ff694d.avif?t=1788888960\" width=1515 height=476 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In a world where the paranormal is normal, the horror industry has gotten incredibly lazy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Jumpscares have become the most boring cliché on earth, and Illy is completely unimpressed. She signs up for a shady haunted house promising true psychological horror... <i>without</i> jumpscares? At least, that's what the waiver says.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Run by yours truly, &quot;Thingy the Thing,&quot; the kicker is this: if you don't get scared, you'll win $10,000!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Illy's constant pushing... things will not end well. And the show will h̷a̷v̷e̷ <strong>NOT HAVE ANY JUMPSCARES</strong> = )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/ec6eac72d8b6bdb98384cfd16b991c82.poster.avif?t=1788888960\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/ec6eac72d8b6bdb98384cfd16b991c82.webm?t=1788888960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/ec6eac72d8b6bdb98384cfd16b991c82.mp4?t=1788888960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Comedy Horror :</strong> A bizarre journey with an unforgettable cast of characters to follow. Sometimes funny, sometimes genuinely terrifying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro &amp; Unique Look:</strong> A beautiful, stylized aesthetic paired with crisp, black-and-white screen-space dither lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Absolutely No... Jumpscares?</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/0e4879a0b726d230872e977c76d37ab9.poster.avif?t=1788888960\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/0e4879a0b726d230872e977c76d37ab9.webm?t=1788888960\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889280/extras/0e4879a0b726d230872e977c76d37ab9.mp4?t=1788888960\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play